#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: init-pulse-for-discord.php
msgid "https://inithtml.com/plugin/init-pulse-for-discord/"
msgstr "https://inithtml.com/plugin/init-pulse-for-discord/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: init-pulse-for-discord.php
msgid "Send notifications to Discord via webhooks. Custom post types, rich embeds, per-category/tag webhooks, test messages, delivery log, and hot-post milestone alerts."
msgstr "Gửi thông báo tới Discord qua webhook. Hỗ trợ custom post type, rich embed, webhook riêng theo danh mục/thẻ, tin nhắn thử, delivery log, và thông báo mốc lượt xem nổi bật."

